{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Searches all commands for a text query, matching case-insensitively against the command name, parameter names, description, imports, and implementation source. Scope with lib and ctl; pass * or an empty string as a wildcard. Returns a JSON array of {lib, ctl, cmd} for every match. A filter over the indexed global store search (dev.search), restricted to commands; an empty query matches nothing. To search control facets (html/css/js/memory...), control descs and text assets as well, use dev.search.query or dev.code.find kind=text.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse crate::dev::search::index::search;\n","params":[{"desc":"Library to search. Pass \"\" or \"*\" to search EVERY library. Required, like every newbound param — pass the wildcard rather than omitting it.","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Control to search within the library. Pass \"\" or \"*\" to search every control. Required — pass the wildcard rather than omitting it.","name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"desc":"Case-insensitive substring matched against command implementation source.","name":"query","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONArray","type":"rust"},"id":"shlglp19ed5d11bf9i2cf3","readers":[],"time":1794497734954,"username":"system","writers":[]}